A Mature Perfectly Normal Cat may purchase:

- Perfect Balance [15].

- Flexibility [5].

- Acute Hearing, up to 4 levels.

- Acute Taste and Smell, up to 4 levels.

- Silence, up to 2 levels.

- Enhanced Dodge 1 [15].

- Upright Posture [10]: Buy off Horizontal. The cat may stand and move normally on the hind legs with both forepaws free as hands, while retaining Extra Legs (Four Legs) to represent comfortable quadrupedal movement.

These Unlocks represent exceptional development of mundane-looking feline capabilities. Explicit supernatural folklore such as Danger Sense, supernatural Luck, Unkillable, or literal nine lives belongs in appropriate Domains rather than the baseline Species.
